  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "On the roof of Fallen Flower Hall, after Mirror Flower wilts, Fang An Lei grows another flower in its place and activates the immortal killer move against a flying spider immemorial soul beast trying to break in. The power locks onto the spider and its speed falls drastically, easing that crisis after Mirror Flower had already forced Divine Bean Palace and Eagle Concubine back. Fang Yuan judges the move wood path with time path power. These two killer moves, mirror flower and fleeting bloom, even though they were rank seven, had a trace of rank eight power when used by Fallen Flower Hall. Two consecutive killer moves leave Fang An Lei pale and seeing stars, costing more than immortal essence, and Fang Yuan judges that she expended her own lifespan.",
      "chapters": [
        1517
      ],
